config QM35_SPI
	tristate "Qorvo QM35 UWB transceiver (HSSPI, UCI char device)"
	depends on SPI && GPIOLIB
	help
	  Transport driver for the Qorvo QM35xx UWB transceiver attached over
	  SPI. It exposes the chip's UCI (UWB Command Interface) as /dev/uci
	  and handles firmware flashing, logging and coredump retrieval.

	  Say M here to build this driver as a module named qm35.
